    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--color-terra);">The 30-Day Promise</p>
    <h1 class="heading-lg mb-4">Change your mind in the first 30 days and your payments come back.</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-8);">If you buy on terms and decide within 30 days that the land is not for you, we refund your down payment and every monthly payment you made. The document fee and monthly service fees are not refunded.</p>

    <h2 class="heading-md mb-3">What comes back</h2>
    <ul class="check-list" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-8);">
      <li>Your down payment</li>
      <li>Every monthly payment you have made</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="heading-md mb-3">What does not come back</h2>
    <ul class="check-list" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-8);">
      <li>The document fee</li>
      <li>Monthly service fees</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="heading-md mb-3">When the 30 days start</h2>
    <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-8);">The clock starts on the date of your down payment. Count 30 days from that day.</p>

    <h2 class="heading-md mb-3">What you need to qualify</h2>
    <ul class="check-list" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-8);">
      <li>You bought on terms (monthly payments). Cash sales are final.</li>
      <li>You are current on your payments.</li>
      <li>You have not made permanent changes to the land, such as building, drilling a well, or installing a septic system or utilities.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="heading-md mb-3">How to ask for your refund</h2>
    <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-4);">Text, call, or email us inside the 30 days. Tell us the property ID and that you want to use the 30-day promise. The refund goes back to the original payment method.</p>
    <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:var(--space-8);">
      <a href="sms:7069630017">Text 706-963-0017</a><br>
      <a href="tel:7069630017">Call 706-963-0017</a><br>
      <a href="mailto:info@landtolandholdings.com">info@landtolandholdings.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2 class="heading-md mb-3">Questions about the rest of the process</h2>
